#: ../../index.rst:2
msgid "Orbit"
msgstr "Orbit"

#: ../../index.rst:4
msgid ""
"Orbit is a desktop genome browser for people who need to look at a locus "
"*now*. It opens as a native window, needs no Java, no server and no setup, "
"and works offline once a chromosome has been visited."
msgstr ""
"Orbit 是一个桌面基因组浏览器，面向那些需要*立刻*看清某个位点的人。它以原生窗口打开，不需要 "
"Java、不用起服务、不用配置，某条染色体访问过一次之后即可离线工作。"

#: ../../index.rst:8
msgid ""
"RefSeq annotations are compiled into a binary index at build time, and "
"sequence is read from UCSC 2bit files — from disk or over HTTP Range — so a "
"whole chromosome of genes loads in milliseconds and the installer stays "
"around 70 MB of annotation instead of carrying a 3 GB genome."
msgstr ""
"RefSeq 注释在构建期就被编译成二进制索引，序列则直接从 UCSC 的 2bit 文件读取——本地磁盘或 HTTP Range "
"均可——所以一整条染色体的基因能在毫秒级加载，安装包只背约 70 MB 注释，而不是 3 GB 基因组。"

#: ../../index.rst:13
msgid "The Orbit window showing three loci side by side with signal tracks"
msgstr "Orbit 窗口：并排显示三个位点及信号轨道"

#: ../../index.rst:18
msgid "What you get"
msgstr "功能一览"

#: ../../index.rst:20
msgid "A native Qt window (no browser tab, no local server to babysit)"
msgstr "原生 Qt 窗口（不占浏览器标签页，无需照看本地服务）"

#: ../../index.rst:21
msgid "18 assemblies across 9 species, annotation bundled"
msgstr "9 个物种共 18 个装配，注释随包内置"

#: ../../index.rst:22
msgid ""
"Gene models with transcript expansion, cytobands, GC and sequence tracks"
msgstr "基因模型可展开转录本，另有细胞遗传带、GC 与序列轨道"

#: ../../index.rst:23
msgid "bigWig and bedGraph signal tracks, multi-sample overlays"
msgstr "bigWig / bedGraph 信号轨道，支持多样本叠加"

#: ../../index.rst:24
msgid "Import your own bigWig, bedGraph, BAM, GTF or FASTA at runtime"
msgstr "运行时可导入自己的 bigWig、bedGraph、BAM、GTF 或 FASTA"

#: ../../index.rst:25
msgid "Split view, deep links, PNG / SVG / PDF export"
msgstr "分屏视图、深链接，导出 PNG / SVG / PDF"

#: ../../index.rst:29
msgid ""
"This documentation is available in English and Chinese. Use the language "
"selector at the top of the left sidebar to switch between ``English`` and "
"``简体中文``. The Chinese translation lives at ``/zh-cn/latest/`` on the same "
"site."
msgstr ""
"本文档提供英文和中文两个版本。用页面左侧栏顶部的语言选择器在 ``English`` 与 ``简体中文`` 之间切换，中文版位于同一站点的 ``/zh-"
"cn/latest/``。"

